        "text_TtEBw9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At , sustainability is not a choice - it’s a way of life. Every step, from sourcing herbs to crafting formulations, reflects our deep respect for nature and our responsibility to preserve it. Inspired by the Ayurvedic principle of <em>Prakruti Rakshanam</em> - the protection of nature - we ensure that our work uplifts the environment, supports local livelihoods, and safeguards the delicate ecology of the Nilgiris.</p>",
