        },
        "icon_list_qmJhfB": {
          "type": "icon-list",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our commitment goes beyond natural ingredients; it extends to how we cultivate, produce, and give back. We collaborate with traditional farmers and women’s collectives across the Nilgiris who follow eco-friendly practices passed down through generations. Together, we nurture the land that sustains us, ensuring balance between what we take and what we return.</p>"
