          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Responsible Harvesting",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>Nature has its own rhythm — and we follow it with patience and respect. At , our herbs and flowers are harvested responsibly and seasonally, allowing plants to complete their full growth cycles before collection. Only mature and potent parts of the plant are picked, ensuring continued regeneration and long-term ecological balance. Our farmers harvest by hand, carefully selecting herbs at the time when their natural actives are most concentrated. This approach minimizes environmental disruption while ensuring that every ingredient retains its natural vitality and therapeutic properties. Through this mindful harvesting, we preserve not just the health of the plant, but also the integrity of the ecosystem it belongs to.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_8HXC9L": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Minimal Waste Production",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>We believe true sustainability begins in how we create. Our small-batch manufacturing process is designed to minimize waste, conserve resources, and maintain product freshness. From water and energy efficiency to recycling leftover plant material for composting, every stage of production is carefully monitored to reduce our ecological footprint. We avoid overproduction and unnecessary packaging, choosing instead to focus on quality, precision, and purity. By keeping our process gentle and controlled, we ensure that every  product honors nature’s generosity without exploiting it.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_j4W9Bg": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Siddha Medicines",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>Created by our ancestors which offer immense scope for innovation with respect to the concept of addressing life-style disorders through nature. In a market undergoing substantial transformations,  takes steps forward to make the best in healthcare available to everyone. With a strong organizational team of experts, we have the ambition to meet the needs of every consumer according to his or her habits and lifestyle. In its own way,  is thus crossing milestones and taking up the challenge of making available high quality Siddha Medicines through continuous innovation.</p><p>To name some:-  Asthma Relief Choornam, Diabetes Choornam, Gas Relief Choornam, Piles Care Choornam etc.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_MFWYir": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Single Herbs Powders",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p> has brought to the market a range of single herbal formulations enriched with goodness and with no side-effects. These are 100% vegetarian and boost your fitness and overall wellness. The hygienically manufactured powders pack in a wealth of Ayurvedic herbs that keep lifestyle diseases at bay. The no-chemical range is powered to give you clear skin, build up stress-resistance, mental fitness, energy, sound sleep, good memory and alertness.</p><p><strong>To name some:-</strong>  Amla, Aswagandha, Arjuna, Aavaram Poo, Adhimadhuram, Brahmi, Drumstick Leaves, Hibiscus, Methi, Manathakalli, Naaval and Vilvam.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_9nJ6Bc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Herbal Cosmetics (Soundarya Prakasha)",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>Herbs have been in use from time immemorial to provide beauty for all. Based on the proven Ayurvedic methodology and the process adopted by our ancestors we have formulated a range of herbal cosmetic products to benefit the world. Herbal cosmetic products always produce greater results, as they enable individuals to express their personalities, gain self-confidence and showcase themselves to others.</p><p><strong>To name some:-</strong>  Almond Cream, Aloe Vera Gels, Hair Care Oils, Sandal Face Packs, Anti Dandruff Shampoos, Herbal Mix Turmeric, Almond Lip Balms, Facial Scrubs and much more.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HLkN8M": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Herbal Food and Nutritional Supplements",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p> understands the developing technical needs and specific food requirements of the growing population. We continuously explore new opportunities and invent new products of the future from the past knowledge. Rallying its innovative strength to preserve the health of the people by providing products that enhance well-being,  has made the universalisation of goodness its project for the years to come. These are exacting challenges, which are a source of inspiration and creativity.</p><p><strong>To name some:-</strong>  Badam Drink Mix, Green Booster, Natural Slim Care, Palm Candy Sukku Milk Mix and Sukku Kappi.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
